      "text": "输入\n                            5\r\n1 4 2 5 7\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            4\n                        \n\n                                                    \n                                输入\n                                4\r\n1 5 8 3\n                            \n                            \n                                输出\n                                -1\n                            \n                        \n                                                    \n                                输入\n                                9\r\n66 53 47 86 18 21 97 92 15\n                            \n                            \n                                输出\n                                53"
